    \;

    <wide-tabular|<tformat|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-valign|t>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-lsep|0em>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-rsep|1em>|<cwith|1|1|1|1|cell-width|0.58par>|<cwith|1|1|1|1|cell-hmode|exact>|<cwith|1|1|2|2|cell-width|0.38par>|<cwith|1|1|2|2|cell-hmode|exact>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      <\itemize>
        <item>Minkowski space <math|\<bbb-R\><rsup|1,s>>,
        <math|x=<around|(|x<rsup|0>,<math-bf|x>|)>>,
        <math|x\<cdot\>y=x<rsup|0>*y<rsup|0>-<math-bf|x>\<cdot\><math-bf|y>>.

        <item><math|x,y> <strong|spacelike separated> if
        <math|<around|(|x-y|)><rsup|2>\<less\>0>.

        <item>Forward cone <math|V<rsub|<space|-0.17em>+>=<around|{|p:p<rsup|0>\<gtr\><around|\||<math-bf|p>|\|>|}>>,
